menu "68000 core (Musashi)"

    config M68K_68020
        bool "68020 instead of the 68000"
        default n
        help
            The machine's CPU, fixed at compile time: a plain 68000 (Atari
            ST, compact Macintosh) or a 68020 (Macintosh LC and II). The
            project's sdkconfig.defaults sets it.

endmenu
